    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="0579" n="481" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg481"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 748.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor of acknowledging receipt
                    of your No. 839, of October 23, directing me, at the instance of the Secretary
                    of the Navy, to convey to the French Government the thanks of the Navy
                    Department for the facilities given by the authorities of Havre on the occasion
                    of the death of a landsman belonging to the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hartford</hi>, and for the courtesies extended on that occasion.</p>
                <p>Your instructions were complied with under date of the 5th instant.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horace Porter.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
